        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Sung-woong, Kim Eui-sung, Go Ah-sung, Hong Won-chan\n- Films: No. 3, New World, The Deal, Office, Train to Busan, The Truth Beneath\n- Roles: actor, director\n- Places: South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Park Sung-woong was born on January 9, 1973, and he is a South Korean actor.\n- Park Sung-woong made his acting debut in the film No. 3 in 1997.\n- Park Sung-woong notably played a gangster in New World in 2013.\n- Office is a 2015 South Korean slasher-thriller film directed by Hong Won-chan and starring Go Ah-sung and Park Sung-woong.\n- Park Sung-woong notably played a serial killer in The Deal in 2015.\n- Kim Eui-sung starred in Office in 2015.\n- Kim Eui-sung starred in The Deal in 2015.\n- Kim Eui-sung starred in Train to Busan in 2016 and The Truth Beneath.",
